{"parse": {"title": "LF-01", "pageid": 97028, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LF-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/LF-02\" title=\"LF-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B7.A8.E6.97.B6.E4.BB.A3.E5.B0.96.E5.8F.AB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"跨时代尖叫\">跨时代尖叫</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 跨时代尖叫</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Cry Across Time</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>另<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>年<span class=\"color-value\"></span>代<span class=\"color-value\"></span>醒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192201</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>恭喜你，贝蒂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>这是给我的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>天呐，我终于可以不用在电影里装成别人了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>受害者C</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/HeadIconSmall-304510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那究竟是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再如何回想，贝蒂都难以分辨出混乱究竟是源自哪里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一场全方位的现实崩溃，宛如娃娃屋被人一掌扇倒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>到底发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界开始瓦解，雨滴从地面上升了起来，与之相反，自己的认知却似乎因为从高处坠落而溶进了片场的水泥地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>翻转，女性的尖叫仍在耳边回响，但那不是贝蒂的声音，是另一个人的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">是我入戏太深，分不清剧本和现实了吗……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div><span style=\"color:#000000\">还是……那其实是能被摄影机记录下来的东西？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂用手掩住了自己的口鼻，以此暗示自己压下心中的恐慌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>贝蒂小姐，现在方便吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来自现实的声音打断了贝蒂的思索，比起心中的恐惧，她更需要先处理眼下的事务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>咳……请进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门后是一名戴着白色面具，身着黑白色职业裙装的女性，她右手抱着一本薄薄的文件夹，款款走了进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看见她被面具遮住的面容，贝蒂下意识地摸了摸自己的上唇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那里并没有自己一直佩戴着的绅士胡，猛然发现这点时，贝蒂感觉自己像是没有穿外衣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>今天是你出院的第二天，感觉好些了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我？哦……还好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“还好”大概是指自己尚且无性命之忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>你的身体恢复得很好，今天就可以开始走收容流程了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虽然戴着面具，但从说话的语调中，贝蒂听出对面的女性是一位和善的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从文件夹中拿出一张表格，将它放到了贝蒂的眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>收容……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>虽然今天就提出来了，但不必着急，你有着充裕的时间进行考虑，毕竟经历了这么大的变故，想必你现在正需要时间来梳理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂接过表格，有些机械地读着表格上的文字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>◇ 圣洛夫基金会 ◇<br /><br />姓    名：_____________<br /><br />性    别：_____________<br /><br />神秘术：_____________</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如此常见的表格，在她20年的人生里，她已经填了几十遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但那些名词只是从贝蒂的唇边溜过了，它们没能挤进贝蒂的脑中，转化成什么“意义”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂停下了阅读，茫然地看着表格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>还有什么问题吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>外面……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂回忆着前不久自己经历过的劫难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-304515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>究竟发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidatang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>这……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性职员将贝蒂带到了客房外的走廊，在这里，贝蒂能脱离基金会风格的装潢，尽可能地窥见新时代的一隅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>剖离基金会走廊中脚步与低语的回声，廊外是一片安详静谧的景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处，入眼的是一片湛蓝的湖。湖上，一叶白帆缓缓地驶向湖心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>岸边，一家几口正在粉白色的餐布上野餐，孩子们在树荫中奔跑，母亲坐在餐布和草地的边界注视着他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>外面现在很安全，你也可以选择在康复后离开基金会……不过，少有人会这么做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阳光和煦，能够将影子切割得很分明，却又不刺眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空气也是如此的新鲜，与充满氯气味道的病房相比，这里更贴近人间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但贝蒂却皱着眉，难以置信地看着这片美景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>这太奇怪了……甚至诡异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼瞳震颤，平和轰然欲坠，但这只是贝蒂自己的灾难。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuidatang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuidatang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/Cg-jijinhuidatang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuidatang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>你并不是第一个这么说的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界是如此美好，昨天与今天并无分别，那我到底失去了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂看着身旁的职员，她的语调仍旧平缓，面具之下，她的脸颊肌肉牵动，似乎仍旧保持着那幅公式化的微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>世界还是这个世界，但确实有一些地方变得不同了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性职员掏出了一支笔，将笔尾抵在嘴角处，沉吟了一会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>那栋房子的房顶换了一批瓦，树也长高了一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/09/HeadIconSmall-508601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>那边那个公园的栅栏之前不是白色的，而是掉了漆的黑色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>职员用笔尾指着，似乎已经对这种变故习以为常，甚至还能心平气和地讲述二者之间的不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将视线移回到了贝蒂的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>如果你想知道你之前经历的究竟是什么，可以在康复之后来参加基金会举办的说明会，在那里，你的疑问会得到解答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>对于那些躲过“暴雨”的幸存者，我们已经形成了一套标准的处理流程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>这套流程既可以帮助你摆脱心理阴影、快速融入新社会，也便于你加入我们，为更多的幸存者提供帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>我们并不会剥夺你自由行动的权利，如果你希望去见见与你一同送来的那位人类女性也可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>总之，欢迎来到雨后的新时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>与我一同送来的人类女性？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳边的尖叫似乎从未散去，甚至愈加清晰了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>是的，她似乎是你的同事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女性职员翻开了手中的文件夹，一页一页地寻找着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>她叫琼斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>琼斯……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jietou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jietou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>我真讨厌这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯一手扶着贴上砖块图样的木板，一手摁着被风刮起的帽子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她那精致的脸上化着夸张又浓重的妆容，像是贝蒂小时候在雨洼里搅拌出来的石头汤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>这里这么高，墙还做得这么粗糙！他们就只是把砖块画贴在了木板上而已，他们什么都分辨不出来，所以把我化成这个鬼样子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高塔布景之上，琼斯毫不遮掩地释放着她的怨气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>我的眼睛好痛！把这么浓稠的粉底糊在我的脸上，我感觉我要晕过去了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-304511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>我会争取一遍过，这样我们就能早点从这里下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂低着头检查着绑在腰间的防护绳，以确保它们不会在镜头之中露馅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再过一会，贝蒂就要扮成男主角的样子，从琼斯的面前一跃而下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>最好我们能一遍过，贝蒂小姐，我听他们说你是很专业的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>嗯……嗯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听着琼斯用如此埋怨的语气讲出赞赏自己的话，贝蒂一时之间也分不清琼斯究竟是什么意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只好埋头检查安全措施，以免触了琼斯的霉头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>若是惹了琼斯不快，像她这样顶级的好莱坞明星，想要开除贝蒂是很轻易的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>他们到底什么时候才会发开拍的信号？他们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯的话像是被切面刀斩断了，贝蒂不免疑惑地抬头去确认琼斯是被什么吸引走了注意力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-513910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>那是什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琼斯的身体僵硬起来，她直挺挺地凝视着远方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-513911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琼斯：</div><div>出事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-304512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着琼斯的目光看去，贝蒂望见了一片她至今无法理解的景象。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jietou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jietou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>怪异的感觉如同洪水蔓延，世界仿佛为贝蒂戴上了万花镜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着难以描述的异样逐渐肢解现实，布景高塔已如孤岛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但随即，高塔也陨落了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">女性职员I：</div><div>她就在里面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>谢谢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将贝蒂带到琼斯的病房后，女性职员便离开了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>厚玻璃后，一名面部缠满绷带的女性躺在玻璃棺一般的仪器中，几块灰白色的方形显示器扭向仪器的头部，关切地看着琼斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>整个房间只有机器滴滴作响的声音，女性似乎沉睡着，胸部的起伏若有若无。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304514.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304514.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-304514.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304514.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝蒂：</div><div>琼斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到了贝蒂的声音，女性向窗边轻轻地侧了侧头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝蒂将手放到了玻璃窗上，耳边的尖叫声停止了，转为了一阵阵微弱的呼吸。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LF-01"}}